"P4013025294" "<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>This is Desdemona. Malaise seems to know you are coming, and he's waiting for you.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>I'm not entirely sure what tricks he'll have up his sleeve, but be aware he likes to mess with dreams.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>I'm also getting signatures of beings that look like Mother Mayhem... but, I don't see how they can be her.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Be careful in there... something does not feel right."
// Generic String :
"P4254774943" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Think you have this in hand, do you? Fools. You are in my realm now. Here, I have the control. Here... I can make your nightmares come alive!"
// Generic String :
"P3840951720" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Think you have this in hand, do you? Fools. You are in my realm now. Here, I have the control. Here... I can make your nightmares come alive!"
// Generic String :
"P2886892482" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Merely creating these Nightmares is just the beginning. Prepare to suffer eternal anguish!"
// Generic String :
"P1355715589" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Merely creating these Nightmares is just the beginning. Prepare to suffer eternal anguish!"
// Generic String :
"P1312419951" "World of Anguish begins!"
// Generic String :
"P1991402773" "<t=10 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>I can see Malaise summoning these creatures from your mind! Let me see if I can find a way to help stop it!"
// Generic String :
"P3868378719" "<t=10 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>I've found something that I think will help, but it'll take me some time to cast the ritual, since I also need to keep an eye on you! Stay alive!"
// Generic String :
"P2057301451" "<t=10 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>The ritual is complete! I couldn't quite get it in time for this round, but the next Nightmare Malaise summons should become your ally!"
// Generic String :
"P3719701669" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Death and decay exudes from your thoughts! Adamastor, I call upon you to destroy these Incarnates!"
// Generic String :
"P3268917735" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Death and decay exudes from your thoughts! Adamastor, I call upon you to destroy these Incarnates!"
// Generic String :
"P2947250330" "Adamastor Emerges from Your Nightmares!"
// Generic String :
"P58976266" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>The Messenger is among your memories! Come, Avatar! Come and crush these Incarnates!"
// Generic String :
"P4073937259" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>The Messenger is among your memories! Come, Avatar! Come and crush these Incarnates!"
// Generic String :
"P2380490469" "The Avatar of Hamidon Emerges from Your Nightmares!"
// Generic String :
"P209129376" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>This must be what Primals think are Clockwork! Babbage, enter the fray and eliminate these fools!"
// Generic String :
"P3077120883" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>This must be what Primals think are Clockwork! Babbage, enter the fray and eliminate these fools!"
// Generic String :
