"P1113497101" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>I have heard tales of a being such as this... Lanaru! Come forth and rain death upon these fools!"
// Generic String :
"P4181766878" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>I have heard tales of a being such as this... Lanaru! Come forth and rain death upon these fools!"
// Generic String :
