"P311369976" "The Lichen Infested War Walker Emerges from Your Nightmares!"
// Generic String :
"P3825755776" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>A creature born of snow and ice! Lord Winter, send these Incarnates into an eternal sleep within the ice!"
// Generic String :
"P978067065" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>A creature born of snow and ice! Lord Winter, send these Incarnates into an eternal sleep within the ice!"
// Generic String :
"P1297244967" "Lord Winter Emerges from Your Nightmares!"
// Generic String :
"P1410510800" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Quite a bizarre machine! So primitive... so powerful. Paladin, destroy these invaders!"
// Generic String :
"P2492630908" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Quite a bizarre machine! So primitive... so powerful. Paladin, destroy these invaders!"
// Generic String :
"P1724557080" "Paladin Emerges from Your Nightmares!"
// Generic String :
"P2249001441" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Such a being is only legend among us, but I see it is real! I summon you, Ruladak. Bring these fools their doom!"
// Generic String :
"P4217555300" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>Such a being is only legend among us, but I see it is real! I summon you, Ruladak. Bring these fools their doom!"
// Generic String :
"P3005663853" "Ruladak Emerges from Your Nightmares!"
// Generic String :
"P2624313106" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>No! If you will not submit to your nightmares, then I shall force you!"
// Generic String :
"P3333952849" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>No! If you will not submit to your nightmares, then I shall force you!"
// Generic String :
"P3264825367" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>I have seen this one's might in your memories! It will destroy you all. Behold, now, the Jade Spider!"
// Generic String :
"P1339929663" "<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>I have seen this one's might in your memories! It will destroy you all. Behold, now, the Jade Spider!"
// Generic String :
"P3477640800" "<color #CC99FF><bgcolor #220055>What? No! How can this be? YOU! YOU Incarnates have stolen MY Nightmare from me?! I will destroy you for this!"
