// Generic String :
"P3407408213" "<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>This is Metronome. I can feel the storm in Penelope's mind about to envelop the node in which she is held.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>I will not be able to do anything to stop the storm, but I can help you mitigate it.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>Find the Storm Voids I create for you. Destroy them, and they will drop a field which will protect you from the storm.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color purple><bgcolor white>Additionally, the Eye of the Storm will let my voice reach Penelope, and this will bring down Mother Mayhem's defenses long enough for you to attack."
// Generic String :
