"P3773155281" "Aurora's Survival"
// Generic String :
"P3471615855" "Defeat Mother Mayhem within 15 minutes while ensuring that Aurora Borealis remains alive. This will break Aurora free of Shalice Tilman's control."
// Generic String :
"P377675663" "<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>This is Calvin Scott. I know what you're thinking. Defeat Mother Mayhem and be done with it, right?<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>It's not that simple. Aurora is still alive in there, but there's no way that Mother Mayhem will let her go quietly.<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>I'm sure that she has planned for this situation, and will use it as a chance to finally kill off Aurora.<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>If she does that, she will finally own Aurora completely, and there will be no way to save her... or the rest of Praetoria!<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color Paragon><bgcolor Black>Make sure that Aurora... my wife... lives through this, no matter what you do!"
// Generic String :
