"P3847774560" "Sever the three remaining connections Shalice Tilman has with the Seer Network and remove her from Malaise within 15 minutes."
// Generic String :
"P4021787718" "<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>This is Desdemona. We finally have Tilman on the run, but she's managed to find a new home in the shell of Malaise's mind.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>She has retreated... with what is left of him in tow... to her secret node within the network.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>From here, it looks like what she might believe the Well of the Furies to look like.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>It is here where we will finally be able to disconnect her from the Network!<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color GoldenRod><bgcolor Black>Chase her out of Malaise and destroy her links to the Network! This may be our last chance!"
// Generic String :
