"P896892593" "You are trapped in the dying mind of Shalice Tilman. Defeat her within three minutes to escape before she takes all of you with her!"
// Generic String :
"P1849590687" "<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor Black>Did you truly think I would let you escape from my network alive!<t=9 x=0.7 y=0.4 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor Black>Mother will not die! Mother is eternal! I shall crush you and I shall regain control of the Network!<t=9 x=0.4 y=0.7 d=8><scale 1.75><color #CC99FF><bgcolor Black>But... but... if die I must, I will ensure that you die with me!"
